/// NV-006 — PAY_QUOTE with a MISMATCHED task binding (key 9 present but ≠ the
/// OFFER's TaskID). Well-formed and correctly signed (it OPENS); pay §3.1
/// requires the requester to reject it as a quote for a different task.
pub const NV006_HEX: &str = "";
/// NV-007 — 2-link delegation chain (RIK→DK→SK) whose child WIDENS the cap
/// scope; `open_delegated` MUST reject it (identity §4 tighten-only, wire 2003).
pub const NV007_HEX: &str = "";
/// NV-008 — LEASE (Key B) whose granted window is entirely OUTSIDE TV-014's
/// requested window; tasks §6 requires the requester to reject it.
pub const NV008_HEX: &str = "";
/// NV-009 - 2-link delegation chain (RIK->DK->SK) whose PARENT declares
/// max-depth 0 yet DK further delegates; scopes are identical (no widening),
/// so only the identity §4 depth bound is violated. open_delegated MUST
/// reject with DepthExceeded (wire 2003). TASK-018 / ARCHITECT RULING 2026-07-12.
pub const NV009_HEX: &str = "";
/// TV-016 — metered PAY_INVOICE (Key B) carrying a UsageWatermark; model-1
